// More functions phase 2 slice A, 2026-11-17. The pending-state block (soWyPendingText): HEAD, one line per item (ITEM; ｜-separated like the brief's records; the chat as its 【聊天】 reference in 「」), then
// the answer format for the kinds present — a transfer only (a call or an @ is answered by an ordinary message). The heading is plain
// text, not a 【…】 tag: an echoed unknown 【…】 line would stop the chat in the parser (study fact 4).
